@startuml
title Collection Run - Detail

skinparam shadowing false
autonumber

actor Maintainer
participant "scripts.collect_all" as CLI
database "Local cache / clone" as Cache
participant "Concrete collector" as Collector
database "data/raw/<source>" as Raw
database "collection_manifest.json" as Manifest

Maintainer -> CLI : select one or all sources
CLI -> Collector : construct from collection config
Collector -> Cache : reuse or populate source cache
Collector -> Collector : parse and normalize logical items
Collector -> Raw : replace source JSONL
Collector --> CLI : manifest entry
CLI -> Manifest : replace with invocation entries

note right of Cache
Reuse is not synchronization.
Record revision separately.
end note

@enduml
